## 4. Parent (Cloud Agent / chat)

1. Default serious parent: **Auto → Optimize For: Intelligence**, or pin `cursor-grok-4.6-high`.  
2. Hardest product orchestration: `cursor-grok-4.6-xhigh`.  
3. If the **user’s ask itself** matches §3.1 (e.g. “KVKK’ya uygun auth tasarla”): prefer parent pin `claude-fable-5-1-thinking-high` / `xhigh` when the UI allows selecting Fable; otherwise keep Intelligence Auto and **force Fable on child Tasks**.  
4. Heavy coding parent without Fable trigger: `gpt-5.6-sol-high`.  
5. Avoid Auto Cost/Balance unless user asks to save spend.

